.
.  Create a GIF file for a block plot
.
DEVICE 1 X11
SET IPL1NA BLOCKPLO.PS
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
.
.  Jim's dplogf.tex defaults
.
SET MINMAX MIN
CHARACTER MAPPING RANK
TIC OFFSET UNITS DATA
XTIC OFFSET 0.2 0.2
YTIC OFFSET 0 3
TITLE DISPLACEMENT 2
DIMENSION 40 VARIABLES
SET WRITE DECIMALS 2
CASE ASIS
TITLE CASE ASIS
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL CASE ASIS
CHARACTER CASE ASIS ALL
LEGEND CASE ASIS
THICKNESS 0.2
.
title size 4
label cases asis
label size 4
tic label size 4
legend size 4
.
skip 25
read SHEESLE2.DAT y weld plant speed shift
.
title Block Plot
y1label Average Defects per Hour
x1label Plant (2) x Speed (2) X Shift (3)
.
CHARACTER SIZE 4 ALL
characters 1 2
lines blank blank
x1tic labels off
x1tics off
xlimits 1 2
xtic offset 0.5 0.5
.
legend 1 Plot Character = Weld Method (2)
legend 1 coordinates 16 86
block plot y plant speed shift weld
.
let string mark = SHEESLE2.DAT
call mark5.dp
.
BOX 0 0 100 100
DEVICE 2 CLOSE
SYSTEM mv BLOCKPLO.PS blockplo.ps
.
QUIT
